DESCRIPTION:Type Hints were introduced in 2014 by PEP484\, marking its 10th
  anniversary in 2024. Mypy reached 1.0 in 2023. How much has changed since
  then? How has the Python code we write today evolved? With strictly typed
  code and runtime checks becoming more common\, is statically typed code s
 till the exception rather than the norm? How much longer will it stay this
  way?
DTSTAMP:20261116T105834Z
LOCATION:Auditorium
SUMMARY:Are We Typed Yet? The Evolution of Gradual Typing and Mypy - Caio S
 algado
